- **Bubble Sort**: Repeatedly steps through the array, compares adjacent elements, and swaps them if in the wrong order. Works well for small datasets.
  ```python
  def bubble_sort(arr):
      for _ in range(len(arr)):
          for j in range(len(arr) - 1):
              if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:
                  arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]
  ```

